# Empty on purpose. `npm run cf-typegen` passes this file to `wrangler types` so that the generated
# worker-configuration.d.ts holds only what wrangler.jsonc declares: without an env file, wrangler adds the
# names in a local .dev.vars, and the file would then differ from one machine to the next and from CI.
# The secrets and the local variables are declared by hand, once, in src/platform/env.ts.
